[h1]Reclaim the Motherland / 重整河山[/h1]

[b]The Mandate may be lost. The dynasty need not vanish with it.[/b]
[b]天命可以失去，王朝不必随之湮灭。[/b]

0.4.1 · CK3 1.20.0.3 · All Under Heaven required

[h1]Rules / 游戏规则[/h1]

“Fate of the Chinese Hegemon” defaults to “Reclaim the Motherland”; “Vanilla Shattering” restores vanilla behavior. “The Choice of the Loyalists” defaults to “Divided Hearts”; “Unwavering Loyalty” keeps every Pro-Hegemon direct vassal.
【中华霸权统治者的命运】默认【重整河山】，也可恢复【群雄割据（原版）】；【尊王诸侯的抉择】默认【人心离散】，也可选择【誓死尊王】。

[h1]When China Fractures / 群雄割据之时[/h1]

[list]
[*]The former emperor loses the Chinese Hegemony but keeps personally held land and unrelated titles. A new empty-de-jure “Later + old dynasty” Hegemony is created, such as Later Song. / 旧天子失去中华霸权，保留个人领地与其他头衔，并建立空法理的【后＋原朝号】霸权，例如【后宋】。
[*]Pro-Hegemon lords decide once using rivalries, close bonds, opinion, character, rank, strength, legitimacy and dread. / 尊王诸侯依照仇怨、羁绊、好感、性情、地位、实力、合法性与威慑，在裂解一刻决定去留。
[*]Loyalists keep the same titles, displayed or custom names, direct liege and complete subordinate realm. Defectors and other direct vassals enter vanilla Chaos reorganization. / 留朝忠臣保留原主头衔、显示或自定义国号、直属关系及下级封臣树；叛者与其他直属封臣按原版割据逻辑重组。
[/list]

[h1]The Later Dynasty / 后朝与旧朝廷[/h1]

[list]
[*]The same Later title and loyalist realm pass to the engine-selected primary heir after the former emperor's death. Other personal titles use normal succession. Existing marked Later titles gain an idempotent succession migration. / 旧君死亡后，同一后朝头衔与忠臣封臣树由引擎选出的主继承人接续；其他个人头衔按原规则继承，既有带标记的后朝可幂等补齐继承合同。
[*]The latest fallen dynasty retains the Three Departments and Six Ministries and their budget eligibility. Eligible loyal incumbents remain; defectors leave; real vacancies use vanilla appointment. / 最近失去天命的后朝延续三省六部九席及预算资格：合资格旧臣原位留任，叛离者离任，真实空缺交回原版任免。
[*]The Mandate, formal Grand Secretariat power-sharing and reigning-Hegemony privileges are not preserved. / 不保留天命、正式中书门下权力分享或现任中华霸权专属特权。
[/list]

[h1]Diplomacy / 和平附庸[/h1]

Later rulers receive no reigning Chinese Hegemony identity advantages. Under CK3 1.20's formula, their ordinary rank bonus stays +10 when the gap exceeds one tier; high-tier refusal reasons return. Other vanilla acceptance reasons remain.
后朝不再冒领现任中华霸权的身份优惠；在 CK3 1.20 的公式中，品级差大于一级时保留固定 +10，并恢复高阶诸侯拒绝项，其他原版接受度理由照常。

Only direct lords actually released by that shattering gain a title-bound “Recently Independent” -50 acceptance reason against the exact Later Dynasty for 1,825 days. Ruler changes cannot bypass it. This is soft resistance; exceptional diplomacy may succeed, and normal diplomacy returns after expiry.
只有本轮实际脱离的直属诸侯获得持续 1825 日、绑定确切双方头衔的【新近自立】-50；双方换君不能绕过。这是软性阻力，出色外交仍可能成功，期满恢复正常外交。

[h1]Proclaim the Restoration / 宣称复辟[/h1]

A Later ruler cannot Claim the Mandate. During Chaos, an independent, adult ruler at peace who controls 51% of China's de-jure counties, including qualifying tributary land, can Proclaim the Restoration. It uses vanilla Mandate effects and removes that ruler's Later titles. Other historic Later Dynasties may continue to exist.
后朝持有者不能【宣称天命】。群雄割据期间，独立、成年且和平的后朝统治者控制中华法理伯爵领 51%（含合资格朝贡国）后可【宣称复辟】，执行原版天命效果并销毁自身后朝头衔；其他历史后朝仍可存在。

[h1]0.4.1 Update / 本次更新[/h1]

Updates CK3 1.20.0.3 vassalization, ministry-budget flags, Chaos ordering and Mandate conditions while retaining the dynasty, succession and restoration rules.
适配 CK3 1.20.0.3 的附庸公式、官署预算标记、割据执行顺序及天命条件，延续现有王朝、继承与复辟规则。

