[h1]Compatibility / 兼容性[/h1]

Requires CK3 1.20.0.3 and All Under Heaven. New single-player games are recommended; cross-major-version save compatibility is not guaranteed. Old Chaos saves do not receive a reconstructed release list. Human loyalists use a deterministic 50-point boundary. Overrides [code]tgp_chaos_shattering_effect[/code], [code]situation_dynastic_cycle_claim_mandate_decision[/code], [code]tgp_has_access_to_ministry_trigger[/code], and [code]offer_vassalization_interaction[/code]; mods replacing those definitions may conflict by load order.
需要 CK3 1.20.0.3 与《溥天之下》，推荐新开单人存档，不保证跨游戏大版本存档兼容。旧割据存档不补造历史释放名单。人类尊王诸侯采用确定性的 50 分分界。同类覆写上述四个定义的 mod 可能产生加载顺序冲突。

